		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Gelatinous cubes can mutate to become magnetic, necrotic, or even regenerative! A massive cube of clear slime with a faint, pink color. Plump mice and centipedes drift around inside. </i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 24, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 touch +4 (engulf + heal), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> -4, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> -4, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 5</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Engulf</strong>. DC 12 STR or trapped inside cube. DC 12 STR on turn to escape.</p><p></p><p><strong>Heal</strong>. Creatures in cube heal 1 HP per round. Treat as if underwater.</p><p></p><p><strong>Rubbery</strong>. Half damage from stabbing weapons.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Art by Lucas Korte, 2023</i></p>",
